/oDeath (for Rodney), and a number of /oTeleport (air elementals, monsters
that get in my way on Astral).  A wand of secret door detection is nice to
have in Moloch's Sanctum, but not necessary.  I usually bring /oPoly if I
have any charges yet, but I haven't used one during the ascension run that
I recall.

It's nice to bring along several potions of FH.

If you could find another ?oGD for the portals it would come in handy; or
you could just write one when you get there.

